warning[prefer-timestamp-tz]: `timestamp` drops the UTC offset when storing a datetime
  ╭▸ 
4 │     created_ts   timestamp
  │                  ━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ├ note: `2019-10-11 21:11:24+02` and `2019-10-11 21:11:24-06` are both stored as `2019-10-11 21:11:24`, even though they are eight hours apart
  ├ help: use `timestamptz` instead of `timestamp`
  ╭╴
4 │     created_ts   timestamptz
  ╰╴                          ++
warning[prefer-timestamp-tz]: `timestamp` drops the UTC offset when storing a datetime
  ╭▸ 
8 │     created_ts timestamp without time zone
  │                ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ├ note: `2019-10-11 21:11:24+02` and `2019-10-11 21:11:24-06` are both stored as `2019-10-11 21:11:24`, even though they are eight hours apart
  ├ help: use `timestamptz` instead of `timestamp`
  ╭╴
